# List

Purpose: the workhorse — instances as rows, the bridge between
dashboard and data. Exists because aggregates only raise questions;
the list is where you see the actual things and click through.

| Option | Category | Values / default | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| size / position | layout | x,y,w,h (default 8x4) | |
| variant | layout | auto / table / cards | cards when w<5: title + meta line |
| density | layout | comfortable / compact | row height |
| title | display | text | |
| icon | display | icon name / none | |
| columns | display | field[] picker, ordered | first = row title in cards |
| orderBy | display | field + asc/desc | |
| limit | display | n (default 10) | |
| footer count | display | on / off | "showing 5 of 132" |
| row click | display | open instance (fixed) | |
| concept | filter | conceptId / inherit | |
| conditions | filter | SidebarCondition[] | |
| match | filter | all / any | |
| archived | filter | exclude / include / only | |
